<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - BOURSE HITS FRESH RECORD TURNOVER.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - BOURSE HITS FRESH RECORD TURNOVER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn bourse had a record turnover of 184.46 million kroons on Wednesday compared to the previous peak of 178.8 million kroons a week ago.</p>
<p>Record trade was a result of active trade in the shares of Hansapank , Hoiupank , Tallinna Pank and Uhispank .</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
